"API entry: [matrix API](../reference/api/matrix), [timeseries "
"API](../reference/api/timeseries)"
msgstr ""
"API 入口: [matrix API](../reference/api/matrix), [timeseries "
"API](../reference/api/timeseries)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/architecture.md:32
#: 5ab002a8391348749bb69e9af6354e79
msgid "2. 4D Field API Model"
msgstr "2. 4次元フィールド（フィールド API）モデル"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/architecture.md:33
#: 1d9b34199d9346079c11ff84fb454447
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Explain why field containers keep all axes aligned during slicing and "
"indexing. **Input:** A `ScalarField` with one time (or frequency) axis and three "
"spatial axes. **Output:** A field object whose grid and axis metadata remain "
"synchronized after selection operations."
msgstr ""
"**目的:** フィールド系コンテナがスライスやインデクシングの間もすべての軸を揃えて保つ理由を示す。 **入力:** 1 本の時間軸（または周波数軸）と 3 "
"本の空間軸を持つ `ScalarField`。 **出力:** 選択操作の後もグリッド情報と軸メタデータが同期したフィールドオブジェクト。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/architecture.md:37
#: a5c54eba472e45e58c63b2231c13457a
msgid ""
"`ScalarField` adopts a 4D structure as its base unit: axis 0 is the **time axis** (or"
" the **frequency axis** after `fft_time()`), and axes 1–3 are the **spatial axes** "
"`x, y, z` (mapped to wavenumbers `kx, ky, kz` by `fft_space()`) — for example `(t, x,"
" y, z)`, `(f, x, y, z)`, or `(f, kx, ky, kz)`. By maintaining all 4 dimensions during"
" indexing operations, the Field APIs are designed to preserve grid information and "
"axis metadata with the data."
msgstr ""
"`ScalarField` は 4 次元構造を基本単位とします。axis 0 は **時間軸**（`fft_time()` 後は **周波数軸**）、軸 1–3 は "
"**空間軸** `x, y, z` です（`fft_space()` により波数 `kx, ky, kz` へ写像されます）。例は `(t, x, y, z)`、`(f,"
" x, y, z)`、`(f, kx, ky, kz)` です。Field API は、インデクシング操作中に 4 "
"次元を保つことで、グリッド情報と軸メタデータをデータとともに保持するよう設計されています。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/explanation/architecture.md:40
#: 9a771d223f8b41ba9934af6833494a8e
msgid ""
"API entry: [fields API](../reference/api/fields), [Scalar Field Slicing Guide"
"](../how-to/containers/scalarfield_slicing.md)"
msgstr ""
"API 入口: [fields API](../reference/api/fields), [スカラー場のスライス操作ガイド](../how-"
"to/containers/scalarfield_slicing.md)"

